=== Does 'in' mean the same thing everywhere? ===
  3 in [1,2,3]               -> True
  'a' in 'cat'               -> True
  'at' in 'cat'              -> True
  'a' in {'a': 1}            -> True
  1 in {'a': 1}              -> False

=== Does len() mean the same thing everywhere? ===
  len('abc')                 -> 3
  len([1,2])                 -> 2
  len({'a':1})               -> 1
  len((1,))                  -> 1
